            <ArticleTitle>Intensive care of the patient after abdominal surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>79-89</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After surgical correction of the underlying abdominal disorder, careful postoperative care is the most important factor resulting in increased survival rates. Intensive care of the postoperative patient can be done practically and economically.</AbstractText>
